{"tool_name":"unibind","contents":["biotools","oeb"],"identifiers":["biotools:unibind"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"unibind","home":"https://unibind.uio.no/","summary":"A map of direct TF-DNA interactions across species.\n\nUniBind is a comprehensive map of direct interactions between transcription factor (TFs) and DNA. High confidence TF binding site predictions were obtained from uniform processing of thousands of ChIP-seq data sets using the ChIP-eat software.\n\nA RESTful API to access the latest version of UniBind database programmatically.\n\nThis API provides an easy-to-use REST web interface to query/retrieve data from the UniBind database. The API comes with a human browsable interface and also a programmatic interface which return the results in different formats, including json, jsonp, yaml, bed, and also api for a browsable interface.","addition_date":"2021-01-18T11:53:21Z","last_update_date":"2026-11-12T14:20:34.931147Z","biotools_curie":"biotools:unibind","credit":[{"email":"anthony.mathelier@ncmm.uio.no","name":"Anthony Mathelier","typeEntity":"Person"}],"documentation":[{"type":["API documentation"],"url":"https://unibind.uio.no/api/"}],"edit_permission":{"authors":["eca008"],"type":"group"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Binding site prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2575"},{"term":"Data retrieval","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2422"},{"term":"Enrichment analysis","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3501"},{"term":"cis-regulatory element prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0441"}]}],"name":"UniBind","owner":"zsmag19","publication":[{"doi":"10.1101/2020.11.17.384578","type":["Preprint"]},{"doi":"10.1186/s12864-021-07760-6","type":["Primary"]}],"topic":[{"term":"ChIP-seq","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3169"},{"term":"Epigenetics","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3295"},{"term":"Gene transcripts","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3512"},{"term":"Mapping","uri":"http://edamo